# Contact form delivery. Leave both empty and the form opens the visitor's mail client.
#
# Easiest: a Web3Forms access key (https://web3forms.com, free, delivers to your inbox).
# The key is public by design (it ends up in the built JS); it only lets people send you mail.
VITE_CONTACT_ACCESS_KEY=
# Or any endpoint that accepts JSON {name,email,phone,message} (Formspree, Basin, your own).
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
